The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 41, with hypertension (levothyroxine 75mcg), seasonal allergies (prednisone taper), and a history of stroke history. My PCP is Dr. Sarah Chen at Denver ..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


